  <datafield tag="505" ind1="8" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Die Kassette enthält: Bochner, Mel: Misunderstandings, a theory of photography( 9 Bl. in Umschlag). Christo: Packed tower, Spoleto, Italy 1968 (9 Taf. in Kassette). Dibbets, Jan: Perspectieef correctie 1967 (1 Faltbl.). Graham, Dan: Two parallel essays, photographs of motion, two related projects for slide projectors (8 S.). Huebler, Douglas: Location piece #2, New York City - Seattle, Washington (18 Bl in Umschlag). Kaprow, Allan: Pose, carrying chairs through the city ... March 22, 1969 (7 Bl. in Umschlag). Kirby, Michael : Pont Neuf, the localization of a tetrahedron in space, 14 June #69 (5 Bl. in Umschlag). Kosuth, Joseph: Notebook on water 1965-66 (14 Bl., 1 Faltkt. in Umschlag). LeWitt, Sol: Schematic drawing for Muybridge II, 1964 , 7/69 (1 Taf. in Umschlag). Long, Richard: Rain dance, August 24, 1969, The Rift Valley, East Africa (1 Taf.). Morris, Robert: Continuous project altered daily, 1969 (17 Bl., Leporellofalt.). Nauman, Bruce: L.A.air (6 Bl.). Oppenheim, Dennis: Flower arrangement for Bruce Nauman (8 Bl., Leporellofalt.). Ruscha, Ed: Babycakes (26 Bl.). Smithson, Robert: Torn photograph from the second stop (rubble). Second mountain of 6 stops on a section (1 Bl., in 4 Teile gerissen, in Pergaminumschlag). Venet, Bernar: Exploited subjects (9 Taf., Ringheftung). Warhol, Andy:  Portraits (1 Bl., 8 Taf. in Plastikhülle). Artists &amp; photographs, [Begleitheft] (19 S.)</subfield>
  </datafield>
